WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.744 --> 00:00:03.250
Yesterday at seven o'clock,
it was raining a lot.

2
00:00:03.363 --> 00:00:05.290
My mom was cooking dinner.

3
00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.330
My brother and I were doing our homework.

4
00:00:07.354 --> 00:00:09.490
Suddenly, the lights went out!

5
00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:13.170
We lit two candles and
finished a puzzle together.
